  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Independent Monitoring and Evaluation - Civil Society Support Programme II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Auditing the Civil Society Support Programme Phase II. The purpose of the CSSP II Programme is to increase trust between government and civil society to deliver enhanced state accountability and responsiveness, resulting in better quality public services. The beneficiaries of this programme will be communities in Ethiopia and Ethiopian citizens, especially the poorest and hardest to reach.</narrative>
  </description>
